%# expected-result: FAIL
%description:

Tests that an 802.1Q tag inserter rejects removing the user priority request
without mapping it, which would discard it unused, at initialization.
The chain is PcpTestChain of lib/Ieee8021qPcpTest.ned.

%file: test.ned

import inet.test.moduletest.lib.PcpTestChain;

network Test
{
    submodules:
        a: PcpTestChain;
}

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
network = Test
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
sim-time-limit = 3.5s
cmdenv-express-mode = false
cmdenv-event-banners = false
**.cmdenv-log-level = off
*.a.cInserter.removeUserPriorityReq = true
*.a.cInserter.mapUserPriorityReqToPcpReq = false

%exitcode: 1
%postrun-command: grep '<!>' test.out test.err > pcp-error.out || true
%contains: pcp-error.out
The removeUserPriorityReq parameter requires mapUserPriorityReqToPcpReq
